{"id":"b2671d7052d589ca","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-strongly-compact.md","title":"Strongly Compact Cardinal","display":"thm-strongly-compact — Strongly Compact Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-strongly-compact","aliases":["58-thm-strongly-compact"],"display":"thm-strongly-compact — Strongly Compact Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-strongly-compact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-strongly-compact</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-strongly-compact — Strongly Compact Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c89f083102fc433\" href=\"?note=0c89f083102fc433\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md\">../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,X,F,U\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,X,F,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyCompact}\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyCompact}\\)</span> (strong-compactness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c89f083102fc433\" href=\"?note=0c89f083102fc433\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md\">../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StronglyCompact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StronglyCompact}_S\\)</span> (compatibility alias defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete filter predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete ultrafilter predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\\mathrm{StronglyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\\mathrm{StronglyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact}\\vdash \\mathrm{StronglyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\forall F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\\land F\\subseteq U)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact}\\vdash \\mathrm{StronglyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\forall F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\\land F\\subseteq U)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A strongly compact cardinal extends every proper <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete filter on any set to a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete ultrafilter.</li>\n<li>Strong compactness implies measurability.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c89f083102fc433","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c89f083102fc433","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StronglyCompact}$ (strong-compactness predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,X,F,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StronglyCompact}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StronglyCompact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\\mathrm{StronglyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact}\\vdash \\mathrm{StronglyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\forall F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\\land F\\subseteq U)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1478,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4445","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-strongly-compact.md|58-thm-strongly-compact]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["0c89f083102fc433"]}